---
heading: Make merch with us
intro: >-
  In a band and need merch that does the music justice? We handle the whole thing —
  art, print, and delivery — so you can show up to the gig with a full table.
offeringsHeading: What we offer
offerings:
  - title: Show & tour shirts
    body: Screen-printed tees and long sleeves in small runs. One colour or several.
  - title: Gig & release posters
    body: Hand-drawn, numbered, and signed if you want them to be. Great for pre-sales.
  - title: Album & single art
    body: Cover art and layout that carries through to the merch so it all matches.
  - title: Merch-table stock
    body: We can keep you supplied between shows and handle reprints when you sell out.
stepsHeading: How it works
steps:
  - title: Reach out
    body: Tell us the band, the idea, how many pieces, and when you need them.
  - title: We quote it
    body: You get a price per piece and a timeline before anything is committed.
  - title: We draw it
    body: Concepts and revisions until it's right. The final art is yours to keep.
  - title: We print & deliver
    body: Small-run screen printing, then pickup in Winona or shipped to you.
ctaHeading: Let's talk
ctaBody: >-
  Send us a note with your band, your timeline, and any art you already have. We'll
  get back to you fast.
---
